    "detailed_description": "Do you like opening <strong>chests?</strong><br>Do you like gaining <strong>gold?</strong><br>Do you like collecting <strong>waifus</strong>?<br>Then this game is for you!<br><br>In Loot Box Waifus, you collect gold via clicking or passively from your waifus. You buy chests to gain more waifus.You can also use your gold for various upgrades.<br><br>Your waifus come in all shapes and sizes. You can collect golden, dark, metallic and retro versions of your waifus. Collecting a full set of retro waifus will grant you additional power.<br><br>But wait, there is more! Once you collect enough orbs, prestige to unlock even more upgrades. With your newly unlocked powers, open more chests, unlock more waifus!",
